
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>beautiful web for sample Website</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f6fb;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #252b48;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #343b60;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffd166;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #ffd166;
            color: #252b48;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: white;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            width: 280px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #00000015;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #764ba2;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #252b48;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>My Website</h1>
        <p>A little creativity makes a big difference.</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>Welcome to My World</h2>
        <p>Discover new ideas and explore something amazing.</p>
        <a href="#about" class="button">Explore More</a>
    </div>

    <div class="section" id="about">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>We believe in creativity, learning, and building great things.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section" id="services">
        <h2>What We Offer</h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Creativity</h3>
                <p>We turn simple ideas into something special.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Innovation</h3>
                <p>We explore new ideas and possibilities.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Learning</h3>
                <p>We learn new skills and improve every day.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 sahir's website | Made with HTML & CSS and by sahir</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
